oftware Stack}\n \t\\begin{itemize}[<+->]\n \t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake} - with numerous dependencies, e.\\,g. \\altverb{GraphViz}\n-\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-executor-plugin-slurm} - SLURM stuff (plus dependency)\n-\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-interface-storage-plugins} - top interface module\n-\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-interface-report-plugins} - for generating reports\n-\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-storage-plugin-fs} - for stage-in/-out\n+\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-executor-plugin-slurm} - SLURM stuff (plus jobstep dependency)\n \t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-wrapper-utils} - for wrapper support\n+\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-interface-report-plugins} - for generating reports\n+\t\t\\item optionally - for stage-in and out: \n+\t\t\\begin{itemize}\n+\t\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-interface-storage-plugins} - top interface module\n+\t\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-storage-plugin-fs} - for stage-in/-out\n+\t\t\\end{itemize}\n+\t\t\\item optionally - for software provenance support:\n+\t\t\\begin{itemize}\n+\t\t\t\\item \\altverb{snakemake-report-plugin-nanopub}\n+\t\t\\end{itemize}\n+\t\\end{itemize}\n+\\end{frame}\n+\n+%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%\n+\\begin{frame}\n+\t\\frametitle{Realization with Package Managers}\n+\t\\begin{warning}\n+\t\tWhilst users can install their software stack individually, this is not desirable due to the multiplying inode usage.\n+\t\\end{warning}\n+\t\\pause\n+\t\\begin{itemize}\n+\t\t\\item A stack for \\textbf{spack} is in preparation.\n+\t\t\\item The same is true for \\textbf{easybuild}\n+\t\t\\item The maintainers of \\textbf{EESSI} are interested in updating their stack twice a year. \n \t\\end{itemize}\n \\end{frame}\n "}]}